      "body": "This PR improves the gradient computation for our `gather_mm` operations used predominantly for MoEs.\r\n\r\n- Adds a new op `segmented_mm`\r\n  The op computes a matmul where the reduced over dimension is segmented and each result is saved separately. When the indices are sorted this allows us to compute the gradients wrt the weights without having to instantiate one matrix per token.\r\n- Removes an unnecessary copying in the computation of the jacobian. When the indices are sorted there is no need to scatter the result, it is already in the correct order.\r\n- Implements gradients for the scales and biases in the quantized gather matmul.\r\n- Fixes the scales and biases gradient for batched qmm.",
      "closed_by": {
